{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01915","headline":"杂曲歌辞 春江曲 · 张籍","name":"杂曲歌辞 春江曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春江无云潮水平，蒲心出水凫雏鸣。\n长干夫壻爱远行，自染春衣缝已成。\n妾身生长金陵侧，去年随夫住江北。\n春来未到父母家，舟小风多渡不得。\n欲辞舅姑先问人，私向江头祭水神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}